notes.content:
Hello, dear players!

We are too happy to announce the update 1.0.2 for EstradaBus HD Demo.  

This upgrade counts with important improvements, for this, we recommend that you upgrade your game between Steam client!

Update items:

[olist]
[*] New vehicles in traffic;
[*] Shader corrections;
[*] Massive improvement in traffic AI, reducing possibility of car crashes and deadlocks;
[*] Localization for Brazilian portuguese in Settings >> Language;
[*] Changes in game map view;
[*] Minor corrections;
[/olist]


Many thanks to downloading EstradaBus HD Demo and for 400 WISHLISTS of EstradaBus HD!

We are attenting to all feedback received between Facebook, Instagram, here in Steam Community and gameplay videos uploaded in YouTube. Once more time, thank you for all support!

Soon, EstradaBus HD will be available in early access and for mobile (Android)

Hello, friends!


The first update of the EstradaBus HD Demo is on the air.

Fixed items 

[list]
[*] Fix of the sound of the bus engines (very low volume);
[*] Fix in the player's first person view;
[*] Fix of bus panel shaders
[*] Minor fixes; 
[/list]


Thank you for download EstradaBus HD Demo. Coming soon, available in early-access and mobile too (Android).
